Digital twin page (custom_components/energylib/twin)
----------------------------------------------------
The house, garden, PV roof, inverter, battery and charging station in the twin are
original models made for this project.

The sports car (twin/models/sports-car.glb) is adapted from "Chevrolet Corvette (C7)"
by Martin Trafas, https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/chevrolet-corvette-c7-2b509d1bce104224b147c81757f6f43a
licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Changes: emblems, licence plate and shadow plane removed; geometry simplified;
textures reduced; meshopt-compressed. Chevrolet and Corvette are trademarks of
General Motors; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by General Motors.

The page bundles these unmodified third-party files, each under the MIT License:

- three.js r128 (twin/vendor/three.min.js and the example scripts GLTFLoader.js,
  OrbitControls.js, EffectComposer.js, Pass.js, RenderPass.js, ShaderPass.js,
  MaskPass.js, SSAOPass.js, SMAAPass.js, CopyShader.js, SSAOShader.js,
